linux-island (@VERSION@) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Settings panel: monitors, colours, every feature on or off, screensaver
    and lock options, start on login; changes apply live.
  * Screensaver and lock: the pill swoops into a clock card and the screen
    fades to a black clock.
  * Event-driven window, volume and camera tracking (much lower CPU use).
  * Volume, brightness and battery icons follow their levels.

